    <pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 10:14:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在蓬勃发展的时代潮流下，各方面的社会压力提前落到了大学生的肩头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期播客中，我们将以兰州大学虐猫事件为引，和大家共同探讨大学生心理压力的来源和疏解方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在拼命地追赶社会发展的过程中，别忘记爱自己哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 事件简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 麦克唐纳三要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 超雄犯罪人假说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">5:07</a> 反社会人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">6:33</a> 社会化的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">7:28</a> 道德规训和犯罪冲动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">8:55</a> 心理底线不断降低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 大学生心理问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 区分情绪和病症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> “他救”渠道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> “自救”方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 心理咨询的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> 年龄差距带来理解差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 马斯洛三角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> 贫富差距带来的认知和解决方式差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> “麻木”和理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 医者难自医</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 原生家庭和心理疾病的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 对心理问题的新闻关注点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 社会趋同化</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目由主播王婧（温柔半两_E8Y)、主播郁苍（Bramble_F）、嘉宾姃姃共同完成</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Silence</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢聆听！顺颂时祺！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见啦~</span></p>]]></description>
