    <guid isPermaLink="false">6635e51603bcdd73a9659c59</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 May 2024 07:34:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>EP.02 应用心理学专业</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期采访对象：姃姃</span></p><span></span><p><span>专业：应用心理学</span></p><span></span><p><span>年级：大学三年级</span></p><span></span><p><span>在物质生活趋于丰富的今天，心理卫生成为了很多人的关注重点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期播客中，我们将围绕应用心理学专业的培养方案、实习和就业情况等内容展开讨论，带大家感受应用心理学专业学生的心理压力和对身边万物的敏感心性。让我们共同感受一场如沐春风的心灵奇旅吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a> 选择本专业的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">4:50</a> 本专业培养方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">6:28</a> 本专业简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">7:58</a> 精神科医生和心理咨询师的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">8:45</a> 朋辈心理咨询</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 自身工作的困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 培训的内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> 心理学实验与论文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 心理学与人工智能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1589">26:29</a> 自身的未来发展规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 督导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 比赛经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 考研好卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 惊喜问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目由主播王婧（温柔半两_E8Y)、主播向彦卓（加加_JwbH）、主播郁苍（Bramble_F）、嘉宾姃姃共同完成</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Silence</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢聆听！顺颂时祺！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见啦~</span></p>]]></description>
