    <guid isPermaLink="false">661bb3715dae7932c664dda9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Apr 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>身处大数据时代的我们经常受到各种信息的裹挟，而这些信息良莠不齐，有的甚至难辨真假。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期中，我们将结合自身相关的上网经历，和大家一起探讨有关虚假信息的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">1:15</a>：被虚假信息裹挟的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">5:46</a>：对于“网络人设”的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">8:25</a>：视角不代表正确</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a>：了解事情全貌的成本高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a>：营销号极赋引导性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a>：虚假新闻的计算机处理方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a>：处理信息的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a>：碎片化时代促使专注力变短 分辨力下降</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目由主播王婧（温柔半两_E8Y)、主播向彦卓（加加_JwbH）、主播郁苍（Bramble_F）共同完成</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Country Roads--The Gypsy Queens</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢聆听！顺颂时祺！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见啦~</span></p>]]></description>
